                                "sense_id": "704e4b46-c90b-364f-89f5-94194b2c5430",
                                "text": "As a further point of clarification, notice that (C0) does not characterize a criterion for determining whether a continuant x of kind K that exists at t 1 is identical to a continuant y of kind K that exists at t 2 ."
